            "review_title": "Review at Chả Cá Lăng Ngon 3b",
            "review_text": "GrandTour66830407691\n1 contribution\n0\nThe fish is cut into large, chewy pieces, marinated simply and dipped in shrimp sauce, very suitable. Oh, the hotpot is very delicious. Service is attentive.\nMar 2024 • Family\nI knew about the restaurant from sharing on the food group so I brought my family to try it. Personally, I find the fish to be very fresh, chewy, and cut into large pieces compared to many other restaurants. The fish is marinated quite simply, but when dipped in shrimp paste, it is very suitable, retaining the aroma of the fish. In general, it suits my family's taste.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten March 18, 2024",
